WEBVTT

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:13.014
An equation is like a balanced scale: whatever you do to one side, do to the other.

00:00:13.014 --> 00:00:20.650
To solve three x plus five equals fourteen, subtract five from both sides.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:26.930
That leaves three x equals nine.

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:41.229
Divide both sides by three, so x equals three. Check by putting three back into the

00:00:41.229 --> 00:00:43.090
original equation.
